      <activity id="b4126d56-d715-53ec-b267-795e40699aef" activityNameId="7e20e2f6-90e0-5f48-83e8-b728341ba6a8" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Lead, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Lead, at regional storage
This dataset describes the supply mix of lead used in Europe. It is modelled with a blend of 25% primary and 75% secondary production, complemented with the transport service required to transport the material to the regional storage. In the global average the secondary production amounts only 65%.;
Formula: Pb; 
UUID: 5097fdf8-210b-3053-9e5a-98fbf73b914f
The module includes the production of primary and secondary lead for Europe.
Location: This module represents the consumption mix of lead in Europe.
Technology: A mix of 25% primary and 75% secondary production.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 8'050'000 in 2005
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5097fdf8-210b-3053-9e5a-98fbf73b914f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
